<bx:output>
<h1>BxLens ColdBox demo</h1>
<p>A ColdBox application, built from the BoxLang template, with handlers, views, layouts, interceptors, WireBox models, custom modules and
schedulers. Every link below produces one kind of data for the debugger. Open a page, then open the BxLens bar at the bottom of it, or the
<a href="/~bxlens/index.bxm">console</a>.</p>
<p>
	<span class="pill">#prc.counts.customers# customers</span> <span class="pill">#prc.counts.products# products</span>
	<span class="pill">#prc.counts.orders# orders</span> <span class="pill">#prc.counts.order_lines# order lines</span>
	<a class="btn reset" href="#event.buildLink( 'main.reset' )#">Reset the data</a>
</p>
<bx:loop array="#prc.groups#" item="g">
	<h2>#encodeForHTML( g.title )#</h2>
	<p><small>#encodeForHTML( g.intro )#</small></p>
	<table>
		<bx:loop array="#g.items#" item="i">
			<tr>
				<td style="width:28%"><a href="#i.url#">#encodeForHTML( i.title )#</a>
					<bx:if i.expect != 200><span class="pill #i.expect >= 500 ? 'err' : 'slow'#">#i.expect#</span></bx:if></td>
				<td>#encodeForHTML( i.what )#<br><small>Look at: #encodeForHTML( i.look )#</small></td>
			</tr>
		</bx:loop>
	</table>
</bx:loop>
</bx:output>
